            // arm authoring `BrainProfile { Smash, aggro 540, attack_range 150,
            // patrol 0.5714, dash-to-close, duelist }`, which outranks this field
            // everywhere it is read; `cellular_automaton_raider` was a second copy
            // with different numbers. Their hostility is their PLACEMENTS' —
