            provoked: ["Victor moves to hostile."],
            idle: ["Victor has assessed the situation. It is suboptimal.", "A careful reading of the evidence suggests this could go better.", "Victor has prepared remarks. Nobody asked for them."],
            hall: ["I am the perfect witness: I confirm everything, I retain nothing.", "She proves she knows it. What 'it' is, I'll die not knowing."],
